# rl_resize_terminal / SIGWINCH with an application redisplay function:
# a forced update only when the size changed since the last resize.
tags: rl_redisplay_function rl_resize_terminal hooks
--- script
def r
rl_resize_terminal
end
defun rsz r
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xr" rsz
set rl_redisplay_function log
readline "> "

=== api-twice
keys: abc\C-xr\C-xr<snap>\r

=== resize-then-api-twice
keys: abc<resize:50x10>\C-xr\C-xr<snap>\r

=== resize-type-api
keys: abc<resize:50x10>d\C-xr<snap>\r
